---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Legal Compliance" description="Legal compliance information for Sinewy Electrical Solutions">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 2.5rem;">Legal Compliance</h1>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.8rem;">Licensing & Certifications</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Master Electrician License</h3>
          <p><strong>License #:</strong> ME-12345-2023</p>
          <p><strong>Valid through:</strong> December 31, 2025</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Our company maintains a master electrician license meeting all state requirements and standards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Business License</h3>
          <p><strong>License #:</strong> BUS-67890-2023</p>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Active and Current</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Registered and compliant with all local, state, and federal business regulations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Insurance Coverage</h3>
          <p><strong>Liability Coverage:</strong> $2,000,000</p>
          <p><strong>Workers' Compensation:</strong> Full Coverage</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Comprehensive insurance protecting our clients and employees in all situations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Safety Certifications</h3>
          <p><strong>OSHA Certification:</strong> Current</p>
          <p><strong>Safety Training:</strong> Annual</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">All team members maintain current OSHA certification and complete annual safety training.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.8rem;">Code Compliance</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        Sinewy Electrical Solutions ensures all work complies with the National Electrical Code (NEC), local building codes, and all applicable electrical standards. We maintain strict adherence to:
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 2rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
        <li>National Electrical Code (NEC) - Current Edition</li>
        <li>Local Building and Electrical Codes</li>
        <li>State and Federal Safety Regulations</li>
        <li>Energy Efficiency Standards</li>
        <li>Environmental Protection Regulations</li>
        <li>ADA Compliance Requirements</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.8rem;">Inspections & Testing</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Regular Inspections</h3>
          <p>All installations are subject to required municipal inspections and testing to ensure code compliance.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>System Testing</h3>
          <p>Comprehensive testing of all electrical systems upon completion to verify proper operation and safety.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Maintenance Records</h3>
          <p>Detailed documentation of all maintenance work with compliance verification and reporting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Safety Audits</h3>
          <p>Regular third-party safety audits to ensure ongoing compliance and best practice adherence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
